==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Azumarill|136}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*{{a|Thick Fat}} is a [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Azumarill}} can have.
*'''Tail Smack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|BW Promo|Snivy|13}} from the {{TCG|BW Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

